Scope Notice (English)

1. This license covers the source code (Source/) and documentation
   (Framework/docs/) in this repository, as well as the compiled mod DLLs
   under Assemblies/ (built from the same MIT-licensed source).

2. Art assets are NOT covered by this license: textures (Textures/), the
   preview image and icon (About/Preview.png, About/ModIcon.png) and other
   artwork are copyrighted by the author and the artist (PSIONIC海豹).
   They may not be copied, modified, redistributed, or used in any other
   project without prior written permission from the copyright holders.

3. Building and running this mod requires referencing RimWorld game
   assemblies (Assembly-CSharp.dll, UnityStubs.dll, etc.), whose copyright
   belongs to Ludeon Studios. This repository does not distribute or modify
   those files, and this license grants no additional rights to use them.

